"@context": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/context/v1"
"@id": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/vertex/structure-decisions"
"@type": "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/ontology/SituationStructure"
label: "ADRs (atomic keyspace, streams, streaming-value I/O)"
statement: >
  docs/decisions/ — ADR 0001 (atomic keyspace), 0002 (streams), 0003
  (streaming-value I/O, proposed draft), 0004 (streaming-value I/O v2,
  supersedes 0003). Append-only; supersede, never edit. Each is registered
  as a Decision vertex in situation/record/ (decision-0001…
  decision-0004); liveness is read from the supersedes chain — 0001,
  0002, and 0004 are live, 0003 is superseded by 0004. Walk the chain
  before relitigating any of these choices.
path:
  - "https://yeetz.dev/bedrock/path/docs/decisions"
